claim.claim-text:
a wireless communication interface (132);
a memory (136); and
one or more processors (134) coupled to the memory, wherein the one or more processors are configured to:

receive (310) content (250);
determine (320) a buffer level of the received content within a buffer (233) in the memory;
determine (330), based on the buffer level of the received content, a speed adjustment;
transmit (340), to a secondary accessory (140) and using the wireless communication interface, instructions to adjust a playback speed of the content based on the speed adjustment at an adjustment time; and
adjust (350), at the adjustment time, the playback speed of the content based on the speed adjustment.

a primary accessory (130), including a first wireless communications interface (132), a first memory (136), and one or more first processors (134) coupled to the first memory;
a secondary accessory (140), including a second wireless communications interface (142), a second memory (146), and one or more second processors (144) coupled to the second memory;
wherein the one or more first processors of the primary accessory are configured to:
receive (310) content (250);
determine (320) a buffer level of the received content within a buffer (233) in the first memory;
determine (330), based on the buffer level of the received content, a speed adjustment;
transmit (340), using the first wireless communications interface, instructions to adjust the playback speed of the content based on the speed adjustment at an adjustment time;
adjust (350), at the adjustment time, the playback speed of the content based on the speed adjustment; and

receive the content;
receive, via the second wireless communications interface, the instructions from the primary accessory; and
adjust, at the adjustment time, the playback speed of the content based on the speed adjustment.

receiving (310), by one or more processors (134), content (250);
determining (320), by the one or more processors, a buffer level of the received content within a buffer (233) in a memory (136);
determining (330), by the one or more processors based on the buffer level of the received content, a speed adjustment;
transmitting (340), by the one or more processors and using a wireless communication interface (132), instructions to adjust a playback speed of the content based on the speed adjustment at an adjustment time; and
adjusting (350), by the one or more processors at the adjustment time, the playback speed of the content based on the speed adjustment.

receive (310) content;
determine (320) a buffer level of the received content within a buffer (233) in the non-transitory computer-readable medium;
determine (330), based on the buffer level of the received content, a speed adjustment;
transmit, (340) to a secondary accessory (140) and using a wireless communications interface (132), instructions to adjust a playback speed of the content based on the speed adjustment at an adjustment time; and
adjust (350), at the adjustment time, the playback speed of the received content based on the speed adjustment.
